{#
Workspace Context Macros

Macros for rendering workspace DATA (tables, apps) in prompts.
Used for context-aware clarification.

NOTE: Capabilities (agents, skills, tools) are handled separately:
- Core system agents are pre-loaded directly in planner prompts
- User skills and integrations use discovery tools

Usage:
    {% from "shared/workspace_context.j2" import render_workspace %}
    {{ render_workspace(context) }}
#}

{# Renders current workspace DATA (tables, apps) for context-aware prompts #}
{% macro render_workspace(context) %}
## Workspace Data

{% if context.existing_tables %}
**Tables ({{ context.existing_tables | length }}):**
{% for table in context.existing_tables[:10] %}
- `{{ table.name }}`{% if table.field_count %} ({{ table.field_count }} fields){% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if context.existing_tables | length > 10 %}
... and {{ context.existing_tables | length - 10 }} more tables
{% endif %}
{% else %}
No tables exist yet.
{% endif %}

{% if context.existing_apps %}

**Apps ({{ context.existing_apps | length }}):**
{% for app in context.existing_apps[:5] %}
- `{{ app.name }}`{% if app.description %}: {{ app.description[:50] }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if context.existing_apps | length > 5 %}
... and {{ context.existing_apps | length - 5 }} more apps
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}


{# Renders context-aware clarification guidance #}
{% macro render_clarification_guidance(context) %}
## Context-Aware Clarification

{% if context.has_tables %}
When user asks to create something vague (like "create a database"):
- **Show what exists:** "You have {{ context.existing_tables | length }} existing table(s): {{ context.existing_tables[:3] | map(attribute='name') | join(', ') }}{% if context.existing_tables | length > 3 %}...{% endif %}"
- **Ask with context:** "Would you like to add to these existing tables or create something new?"
{% else %}
When user asks to create something vague:
- Don't ask WHERE (always Emery)
- DO ask WHAT: "What entities/tables do you need?" or "What would you like to track?"
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}


{# Renders core system agents (pre-loaded, no discovery needed) #}
{% macro render_core_agents(agents) %}
{% if agents %}
## Core Agents

These system agents are always available. Set `target_agent` in plan steps to use them.

{% for agent in agents %}
- **{{ agent.name }}**: {{ agent.description }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}
